---
This is a modified version of Headscale (https://github.com/juanfont/headscale)
called "StealthScale" that integrates Xray/VLESS protocol for enhanced
stealth capabilities to bypass network restrictions.

Modifications include:
- Replacement of WireGuard with Xray/VLESS for node-to-node transport
- Command line interface renamed to "stscale"
- DERP relay enabled by default for improved connectivity
- Enhanced obfuscation capabilities to evade deep packet inspection

See README.md for build and usage instructions.

---

